"Blood-Splattered Cavern"
"Even against the pure-black ice that covers the tunnel walls here is the

dull, crimson stain of old blood.  It is nearly everywhere - on the

walls, the floor, even the ceiling.  This alcove is quiet but smells

foul, the air thick with the stench of rotting meat.  The north wall is a

sheet of nearly transparent ice.

